<title>NORWAY: SOCCER--NORWAY BEAT HUNGARY 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER--NORWAY BEAT HUNGARY 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway beat Hungary 3-0 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0) in a World Cup soccer European group three qualifier on</p>
<p>Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Kjetil Rekdal (83rd, 89th, 90th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 22,480</p>
<p>Group three standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Norway		 2   2   0   0   8   0    6</p>
<p> Switzerland	  2   1   0   1   3   3    3</p>
<p> Hungary		2   1   0   1   1   3    3</p>
<p> Azerbaijan	   2   1   0   1   1   5    3</p>
<p> Finland		2   0   0   2   2   4    0</p>
<p>Next matches: Nov 10 Switzerland v Norway, Azerbaijan v</p>
<p>Hungary</p>
</text>
